## IMS local state — never commit. Credentials live in Windows Credential
## Manager (DEC-9); connection stores and query history are per-user (DEC-8).
*.ims.local.json
local.settings.json

## Claude Code — per-user overrides only; .claude/settings.json is committed.
.claude/settings.local.json

## Site: /help/ is generated at deploy time by .github/workflows/pages.yml
## from src/Ims.App/Resources/Help/ims-help.html. Copy it locally to preview;
## never commit it, or the published manual can drift from the shipped one.
site/help/
